SUMMARY:AVL Digital Nomads - Book Club
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**August 2026 Selection - *The Midnight Tr
 ain* by Matt Haig**\n[Amazon](https://www.amazon.com/Midnight-Train-Novel-
 World/dp/0593833376/) - [GoodReads](https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/24
 2380266-the-midnight-train)\n\n*When your life flashes before your eyes\, 
 where would you stop?*\n\n*No one can change the past\, but the Midnight T
 rain can take you there.*\n\n*The chance to re-live the moments that meant
  most.*\n\n*To see what kind of person you really were.*\n\n*For Wilbur hi
 s best days were with Maggie\, the love of his life. On his honeymoon in V
 enice.*\n\n*Before he gave it all away.*\n\n*He wishes he could go back an
 d live differently. But to do so risks everything . . .*\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n
 \n**Welcome to our monthly Book Club!** We’re a small\, friendly group t
 hat gets together for fun\, thoughtful conversations about a different boo
 k each month.\n\nFinished the whole book? Great. Only made it through a fe
 w chapters? Still come. Didn’t read it at all but the discussion sounds 
 interesting? Honestly\, you’re welcome too.\nWe meet on the **first Tues
 day of every month**.\n\nOne of the best things about this group is that w
 e keep it relatively small and guide the conversation\, so it doesn’t tu
 rn into three people talking while everyone else quietly questions their l
 ife choices. Everyone has a chance to jump in\, share their thoughts\, and
  explore the book’s characters\, themes\, writing\, and bigger ideas.\n\
 nYou definitely don’t need to be a literary expert. Whether you read con
 stantly or you’re trying to get back into it\, this is a relaxed place t
 o discover new books\, hear different perspectives\, and meet some great p
 eople along the way.
