SUMMARY:Manifesting Self
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Location Change:**\n**Disclaimer: In all
  efforts to keep this Meetup a safe space\, we all agree to keep anything 
 said within the group private and confidential.**\n\nDo you want to take y
 our remote working game to the next level? Do you find yourself saying wtf
  is Manifesting Self??\n\nWell\, you’re not alone. Remote working is gla
 morous\, and also presents itself with challenges not seen in the traditio
 nal office environment.\n\nManifesting Self may sound a little out there. 
 Trust me. It’s not. Whether we’ve been in the remote space for years\,
  since the pandemic\, or just recently\, I’m certain it has changed each
  of us in ways we never thought possible. Let’s explore that together. T
 he highs\, the lows\, and everywhere in between. And from there experience
  growth.\n\nWe are so excited to see you\, again or for the first time!
